  "overview": {
    "en": "Late 19th century in Alexandria. Two traditionally rival Turkish families, \"Seferoglu\"s and \"Tellioglu\"s are competing for the \"Green Valley\". The winner will be determined by Daver Bey, who has a beautiful young daughter, Leyla. Both families try to arrange a marriage between a man from their family and Leyla, so that Daver Bey will be inclined to give the green valley to his \"relatives\". Tellioglus, who are behind in the race, desperately find a final solution: They will fake their idiotic butler, Saban, as the highest ranked Ottoman soldier in Egypt: Tosun Pasha.",
    "tr": "Seferoğulları ve Tellioğulları aileleri Yeşil Vadi için sürekli didişmektedirler. Tellioğulları, Yeşil Vadi'yi ve Daver Bey'in kızını alabilmek için uşak Şaban'ı Tosun Paşa kılığına sokarlar. Gerçek Tosun Paşa'nın bu olayı duymasıyla işler karışır."
  },
